        <mxCell id="github" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub&lt;/b&gt; R-PalaceOnDanse/Cloud-Native-DevOps&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PR checks: terraform-ci (fmt, validate, tflint, plan dev + prd),&lt;br&gt;functions-ci, frontend-ci, secret-scan (gitleaks), auth-check&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Release: tag vX.Y.Z on main -&gt; terraform-deploy:&lt;br&gt;foundation dev -&gt; serverless dev -&gt; frontend dev -&gt;&lt;br&gt;foundation prd -&gt; serverless prd -&gt; frontend prd&lt;br&gt;(environment prd: required reviewers)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ruleset protect-main: PR + 1 approval, signed&lt;br&gt;commits, gitleaks check, no force push / deletion" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3C4043;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
